{"client_side":"unsupported","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.16.5","1.18.2","1.19.2","1.19.3","1.19.4","1.20","1.20.1","1.20.2","1.20.3","1.20.4","1.20.5","1.20.6","1.21","1.21.1","1.21.2","1.21.3","1.21.4","1.21.5","1.21.6","1.21.7","1.21.8","1.21.9","1.21.10","1.21.11","26.1","26.1.1","26.1.2","26.2","26.3"],"environment":["server_only"],"id":"ZcqNoW8j","slug":"skeleton-horse-spawn","project_type":"mod","team":"lBeyy2FV","organization":null,"title":"Skeleton Horse Spawn","description":"☠🐴 Allows skeleton horses to spawn naturally with a skeleton riding it and other tweaks.","body":"<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Mod. Made with love. Lots of active mods for Fabric, Forge and Neo!\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"About the mod\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>Skeleton Horse Spawn is a minimalistic configurable mod which allows skeleton horses to spawn naturally with a skeleton riding it. Whenever a skeleton spawns, it has a chance to be spawned as a rider. You can configure it to only spawn on the surface and if it should burn in daylight.<br><br></p>\n<p>You may also be interested in <span><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/giant-spawn\">Giant Spawn</a></strong></span> or&nbsp;<span><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/zombie-horse-spawn\">Zombie Horse Spawn</a></strong></span>.</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"Included in The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/spawn-bundle.svg\" alt=\"Included in Serilum&#x27;s Spawn Bundle\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"Environment: Server\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"Configurable\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"Configuration guide\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;All available config options:</p>\n<details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary>\n<p><span><strong>chanceSurfaceSkeletonHasHorse</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default 0.05, min 0, max 1.0<br>The chance a skeleton that has spawned on the surface is riding a horse.<br><br><span><strong>shouldBurnSkeletonHorsesInDaylight</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default true<br>If enabled, burns skeleton horses when daylight shines upon them.<br><br><span><strong>onlySpawnSkeletonHorsesOnSurface</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default true<br>If enabled, a skeleton horse with rider will only spawn on the surface.<br><br><span><strong>skeletonHorsesCanDespawn</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default true<br>If enabled, skeleton horses spawned by the mod despawn like other monsters when no player is near. A horse with a saddle, armor, an owner, a name tag or a lead stays.<br><br><span><strong>dimensionsToSpawnIn</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default \"\"<br>Dimensions in which skeletons can spawn riding a skeleton horse, separated by a comma. Leave empty for every dimension. For example: 'minecraft:overworld'.<br><br><span><strong>biomesToSpawnIn</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default \"\"<br>Biomes in which skeletons can spawn riding a skeleton horse, separated by a comma. Biome tags work too, starting with a '#'. Leave empty for every biome. For example: 'minecraft:plains,#minecraft:is_savanna'.</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>You may freely use this mod in any modpack, as long as the download remains hosted within the CurseForge or Modrinth ecosystem.</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> contains an overview and more information on all mods available.</span><br><span><br>For issues, ideas, suggestions or anything else there is the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github repo</a>. Thanks!</span><span><br><br></span></p>","body_url":null,"published":"2022-09-01T08:54:19.416156Z","updated":"2026-10-20T10:56:57.235622Z","approved":null,"queued":null,"status":"approved","requested_status":null,"moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved","name":"","url":null},"downloads":1037339,"followe